   * `CHANGELOG.md:945`: "Nothing else in the handler, its sibling X(fcnvds_drm_fpul) or the decoder (:5061-5068) changes." - Overclaims "Nothing else... changes" without proving the full file diff outside of the 5-1 line count. (UNSETTLED: requires `product.diff`).

4. **Reviewer Findings (Most likely to be flagged)**
   * A reviewer would flag the **broken chain of custody regarding the PRETABLE predictions**. At `CHANGELOG.md:985-986`, the author admits `PRETABLE.out` was written over ("its own mtime no longer proves the order because the M_g correction was written into it in place at 17:29"). Modifying a prediction file *after* the runs to correct a prediction invalidates the cryptographic/timestamp proof of the prediction occurring before the table run.
